    "p1": "The Cedar Forest of Ifrane (often associated with the Gouraud Forest) is a breathtaking natural expanse in the Middle Atlas mountains. Home to majestic, centuries-old Atlas cedar trees, it offers tranquil walking trails, fresh pine air, and stunning landscapes that change color with the seasons.",
